a(f"\nThe composition of phases differs little between the two groups (chi-square test on sessions, descriptive, p = {calc('E7 phase mix p', float(df(E7['phase_mix']).p_rows_descriptive.iloc[0]), '{:.2f}', E7['phase_mix'], 'p_rows_descriptive')}), but **progesterone is higher in the longitudinal women in each of the three phases** (all three intervals exclude 0), while estradiol is not. **Multivariate check:** a logistic classifier trained to tell the two groups apart from the features, cross-validated by woman, gives the following area under the ROC curve (0.5 = indistinguishable):\n")
