table("T-E7-auc", "classifier two-sample AUC", E7["shift_auc"], "src/ext_e7_shift.py")
AU = df(E7["shift_auc"]).set_index("fset"); claim(AU.loc["A", "auc_lo"] <= 0.5 <= AU.loc["A", "auc_hi"] and AU.loc["C", "auc_lo"] > 0.5, "phase alone does not separate the groups, phase + hormones does")
a("\nPhase alone does not separate the two groups (the interval contains 0.5); phase plus hormones does, so the groups differ in the relation between hormone levels and phase, not in the phase mix. **Target spread and mean (per direction):**\n")
a("| Direction | Target | Training mean | Test mean | Training SD | Test SD | SD ratio test / train | Baseline RMSE | Share of baseline MSE due to the mean shift |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
